# fixtures.manifest -- every SAGE26 oracle fixture, grouped by the Mimic module that owns it.
#
# 'module <module> <count>' declares a module and how many fixtures it owns; each
# 'fixture <module> <name>' that follows names one fixture, whose files are
# models/sage26/modules/<module>/_tests/oracle/<name>.in (input) and <name>.out (oracle output).
# regenerate.sh refuses to run unless this list, the counts and the inputs on disk agree.
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.

